1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,350
Korang tunggu mata sakit baru nak jumpa doktor?

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:04,200
Itu silap besar.

3
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:06,850
Menurut Tinjauan Kolej Oftalmologi,

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,550
dapati lebih 8 daripada 10

5
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:12,450
rakyat Malaysia tak sedar

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,950
atau tak pasti tentang penyakit retina

7
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:16,620
yang boleh buat hilang penglihatan

8
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:18,750
dan ramai tunggu berminggu,

9
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:20,360
malah berbulan-bulan

10
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:21,850
sebelum pemeriksaan mata.

11
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:24,800
Bancian Mata Kebangsaan 2014,

12
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:26,780
63 ribu rakyat Malaysia

13
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:29,600
berumur 50 tahun ke atas buta.

14
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:32,700
60 peratus daripadanya boleh dirawat.

15
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:35,100
Boleh dirawat, tapi tak sempat.

16
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:37,620
Kencing manis pun satu punca utama kebutaan,

17
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:40,800
daripada kira-kira 10 peratus kes.

18
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:42,800
Ramai kata, “saya masih nampak.”

19
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:44,350
Alasan itu salah.

20
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:46,100
Jangan tunggu sampai terlambat.

21
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:48,850
Lakukan pemeriksaan mata sekarang.

22
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,120
Untuk sokongan harian,

23
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:52,150
kita ada DS Pharma Eye Care,

24
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:53,700
berdaftar dengan MAL22076147T,

25
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:55,600
digunakan secara tradisional

26
00:00:55,620 --> 00:00:57,340
untuk kesihatan mata.

27
00:00:57,360 --> 00:00:59,520
Bukan rawatan penyakit mata

28
00:00:59,540 --> 00:01:01,330
dan bukan ganti pemeriksaan.
